<title>USA: Barry's Jewelers says in compliance.</title>
<headline>Barry's Jewelers says in compliance.</headline>
<dateline>MONROVIA, Calif. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barry's Jewelers Inc said Wednesday it is in compliance with all covenants under its banking agreements with Bank Boston and other lenders.</p>
<p>It also said it has negotiated new covenants under those agreements.</p>
</text>
